{"seq":1,"slug":"accounting-software-erp","title":"会计软件与ERP系统","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/accounting/digital-finance/accounting-software-erp","wordCount":1672,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"会计软件与erp系统\">会计软件与ERP系统</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>会计软件和ERP（企业资源计划）系统是现代财务工作的核心工具。中职会计毕业生进入企业后，日常操作的载体就是这些系统。掌握用友、金蝶等主流软件的操作逻辑，理解ERP财务模块的数据流转，是从&quot;手工账&quot;过渡到&quot;信息化账务&quot;的关键一步。</p>\n<h3 id=\"会计信息化发展历程\">会计信息化发展历程</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;手工记账&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;单机版财务软件&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;网络版ERP&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;云财务SaaS&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;智能财务平台&quot;]&#10;&#10;    A --- A1[&quot;纸质凭证/账簿&quot;]&#10;    B --- B1[&quot;用友T3/金蝶KIS&quot;]&#10;    C --- C1[&quot;用友U8/金蝶K3&quot;]&#10;    D --- D1[&quot;用友YonSuite/金蝶云星辰&quot;]&#10;    E --- E1[&quot;AI+RPA+大数据&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[\"手工记账\"] --&gt; B[\"单机版财务软件\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"网络版ERP\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"云财务SaaS\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"智能财务平台\"]\n\n    A --- A1[\"纸质凭证/账簿\"]\n    B --- B1[\"用友T3/金蝶KIS\"]\n    C --- C1[\"用友U8/金蝶K3\"]\n    D --- D1[\"用友YonSuite/金蝶云星辰\"]\n    E --- E1[\"AI+RPA+大数据\"]</pre><h3 id=\"用友软件操作要点\">用友软件操作要点</h3><p>用友软件是国内市场份额最大的财务软件，从教学版T3到企业版U8/NC再到云端YonSuite，覆盖不同规模企业。核心操作流程：</p>\n<p><strong>系统初始化</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>建立账套：设定企业名称、会计期间（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>月-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span></span></span></span></span>月）、记账本位币</li>\n<li>设置会计科目：在一级科目基础上增设明细科目（如&quot;应收账款-客户A&quot;）</li>\n<li>录入期初余额：将手工账或旧系统数据迁移，确保试算平衡</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><mtext>借方期初余额</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo>∑</mo><mtext>贷方期初余额</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum \\text{借方期初余额} = \\sum \\text{贷方期初余额}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6em;vertical-align:-0.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">借方期初余额</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6em;vertical-align:-0.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">贷方期初余额</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><ol start=\"4\">\n<li>设置操作员权限：制单人、审核人不能为同一人（内控要求）</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>日常业务处理</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>内控要求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>填制凭证</td>\n<td>录入摘要、科目、金额</td>\n<td>借贷必平</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>审核凭证</td>\n<td>另一操作员审核</td>\n<td>制单与审核分离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>记账</td>\n<td>将已审核凭证过账</td>\n<td>不可逆操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>月末结转</td>\n<td>自动生成损益结转凭证</td>\n<td>机制转账</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>期末结账</td>\n<td>关闭当期，进入下期</td>\n<td>需所有模块结账</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"金蝶软件操作要点\">金蝶软件操作要点</h3><p>金蝶系列（KIS、K/3、云星辰）在中小企业市场占有率高，教学中常用金蝶KIS标准版。其界面风格与用友有差异，但核心逻辑相通：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>科目体系</strong>：支持辅助核算（客户、供应商、部门、项目），无需设大量明细科目</li>\n<li><strong>智能凭证</strong>：模板化常见业务（如&quot;工资计提&quot;&quot;折旧计提&quot;），一键生成</li>\n<li><strong>报表系统</strong>：内置报表公式（类似Excel），自动从账簿取数生成报表</li>\n</ul>\n<p>金蝶辅助核算的优势在于科目设置精简。传统做法：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"1122 应收账款&#10;  112201 应收账款-甲公司&#10;  112202 应收账款-乙公司&#10;  ...（可能上百个明细科目）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>1122 应收账款</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  112201 应收账款-甲公司</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  112202 应收账款-乙公司</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ...（可能上百个明细科目）</span></span></code></pre></div><p>辅助核算做法：仅设一个&quot;1122 应收账款&quot;科目，挂&quot;客户&quot;辅助核算维度，系统自动按客户分类汇总。</p>\n<h3 id=\"erp财务模块\">ERP财务模块</h3><p>ERP系统将财务与业务深度集成，财务数据不再是事后记录，而是业务流转的实时反映：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;采购模块&quot;] --&gt;|采购入库| B[&quot;存货模块&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|材料出库| C[&quot;生产模块&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|产成品入库| B&#10;    B --&gt;|销售出库| D[&quot;销售模块&quot;]&#10;&#10;    A --&gt;|应付单| E[&quot;应付模块&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|应收单| F[&quot;应收模块&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; G[&quot;总账模块&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    B --&gt;|存货核算| G&#10;    G --&gt; H[&quot;报表模块&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"采购模块\"] --&gt;|采购入库| B[\"存货模块\"]\n    B --&gt;|材料出库| C[\"生产模块\"]\n    C --&gt;|产成品入库| B\n    B --&gt;|销售出库| D[\"销售模块\"]\n\n    A --&gt;|应付单| E[\"应付模块\"]\n    D --&gt;|应收单| F[\"应收模块\"]\n    E --&gt; G[\"总账模块\"]\n    F --&gt; G\n    B --&gt;|存货核算| G\n    G --&gt; H[\"报表模块\"]</pre><p>在ERP环境下，业务单据（采购订单、入库单、销售出库单）按预设规则自动生成会计凭证，实现&quot;业财一体化&quot;：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>业务单据</th>\n<th>自动生成凭证</th>\n<th>示例分录</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>采购入库单</td>\n<td>材料入库凭证</td>\n<td>借：原材料 / 贷：应付账款</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>销售出库单</td>\n<td>收入确认凭证</td>\n<td>借：应收账款 / 贷：主营业务收入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>付款单</td>\n<td>付款凭证</td>\n<td>借：应付账款 / 贷：银行存款</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"云财务平台\">云财务平台</h3><p>云财务（SaaS模式）是中小企业财务管理的发展方向，代表产品包括用友YonSuite、金蝶云星辰、畅捷通好会计等。</p>\n<p>云财务的核心特征：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>免安装免维护</strong>：浏览器登录即可使用，数据存储在云端</li>\n<li><strong>多端协同</strong>：PC端、手机端、平板端随时办公</li>\n<li><strong>自动数据采集</strong>：对接银行流水、电子发票平台、电商平台</li>\n<li><strong>智能记账</strong>：根据银行交易摘要和发票信息自动匹配科目</li>\n</ol>\n<p>传统软件 vs 云财务成本对比（年均，以10用户为例）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>项目</th>\n<th>传统软件</th>\n<th>云财务</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>软件费用</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30000</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>80000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">80000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80000</span></span></span></span></span>（一次性）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5000</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15000</span></span></span></span></span>/年</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>服务器</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15000</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30000</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>（含在订阅费）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运维人员</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>80000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">80000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80000</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>120000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">120000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">120000</span></span></span></span></span>/年</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>升级费</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5000</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10000</span></span></span></span></span>/年</td>\n<td>免费自动升级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>对于年营收 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">500</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span></span></span></span></span> 万以下的小微企业，云财务的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 年总拥有成本（TCO）仅为传统方案的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30%</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50%</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"会计软件操作规范\">会计软件操作规范</h3><p>无论使用哪种软件，均需遵循以下操作规范：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>权限分离</strong>：录入、审核、出纳必须分人操作</li>\n<li><strong>备份制度</strong>：每日自动备份 + 每周手动备份至异地</li>\n<li><strong>操作日志</strong>：系统自动记录所有操作，不可删改</li>\n<li><strong>年度建账</strong>：新年度开始前完成年度结转</li>\n<li><strong>数据安全</strong>：强密码策略、定期修改、离职即注销</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><p><strong>云原生财务成为标配</strong>：2025年新注册中小企业中超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>70</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">70\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">70%</span></span></span></span></span> 选择云财务产品，传统单机版软件市场持续萎缩。用友和金蝶均将战略重心转向云服务，推动存量客户&quot;上云&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>银企直联智能对账</strong>：云财务平台与银行系统直连后，企业银行流水实时同步到财务系统，系统通过AI自动匹配对应的客户/供应商和科目，手工对账工作量减少 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">80\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80%</span></span></span></span></span> 以上。</p>\n<p><strong>票财税一体化</strong>：全电发票数据自动流入财务系统，系统根据发票信息自动生成凭证、自动计算进项税额、自动预填纳税申报表，形成&quot;开票→记账→申报&quot;的全自动链路。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>在用友软件中建立一个新账套，需要设置哪些基础信息？为什么要求&quot;制单人与审核人不能为同一人&quot;？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>解释ERP系统中&quot;业财一体化&quot;的含义：采购部门录入一张采购入库单后，财务模块会发生什么变化？不需要财务人员手工做什么？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>对比分析：一家年营收 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>200</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">200</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span></span></span></span></span> 万元、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 名会计的小企业，选择传统金蝶KIS还是金蝶云星辰更合适？从成本、功能、维护三个维度论证。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>思考：会计软件的自动记账功能是否会完全取代会计人员的判断？举出两个必须依赖人工判断的业务场景。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>会计软件从单机版演进到云端SaaS，操作载体从本地安装变为浏览器登录，但核心逻辑未变——以会计科目为骨架、以借贷记账法为规则、以凭证为载体。ERP系统通过业财一体化实现业务驱动财务，减少手工录入和人为差错。云财务平台凭借低成本、免运维、智能化的优势成为中小企业标配。中职会计毕业生需要同时掌握用友/金蝶的操作技能和ERP的业务逻辑思维，才能适应&quot;财务数字化&quot;的岗位要求。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"会计软件与ERP系统","id":"会计软件与erp系统"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"会计信息化发展历程","id":"会计信息化发展历程"},{"level":3,"text":"用友软件操作要点","id":"用友软件操作要点"},{"level":3,"text":"金蝶软件操作要点","id":"金蝶软件操作要点"},{"level":3,"text":"ERP财务模块","id":"erp财务模块"},{"level":3,"text":"云财务平台","id":"云财务平台"},{"level":3,"text":"会计软件操作规范","id":"会计软件操作规范"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"纳税申报与合规","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/accounting/tax-practice/tax-filing-compliance"},"next":{"title":"Excel财务分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/accounting/digital-finance/excel-financial-analysis"}}